{"seq":2,"slug":"portfolio-integration","title":"组合整合","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"allocation-sizing","title":"配置比例决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/allocation-sizing","wordCount":2391,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"correlation-regime","title":"相关性体制变化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/correlation-regime","wordCount":2429,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"rebalancing-crypto","title":"加密资产再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/rebalancing-crypto","wordCount":2628,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"组合整合\">组合整合</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>将加密资产纳入传统投资组合不是简单地「买一些比特币」，而是一个需要量化分析的资产配置决策。本章回答三个核心问题：配多少（Sizing）、何时相关性会变化（Regime）、以及如何在高波动环境下维护目标权重（Rebalancing）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置比例决策</td>\n<td>如何科学地确定 1%-5% 的加密资产配置比例？理论依据与实践约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性体制变化</td>\n<td>加密资产与传统资产的相关性如何随宏观环境切换？2026年新范式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密资产再平衡</td>\n<td>高波动环境下的再平衡频率、跨交易所操作与税务优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Kelly Criterion</strong>：基于赢率和赔率确定最优下注比例的数学框架</li>\n<li><strong>体制切换</strong>：相关性并非恒定，而是在不同宏观体制（Risk-on/Risk-off）间跳跃</li>\n<li><strong>波动率拖累</strong>：高波动资产因几何收益 &lt; 算术收益，需要更频繁的再平衡</li>\n</ul>\n"}